><figure><img alt=\"《八仙！》劇照（微博@電影八仙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260727/1158470556228784128619275.jpeg/n4lS8Abg-5tR4YDCvQGaO08p-haf0FyUT7JlsE-yZbA\"/><figcaption>《八仙！》劇照（微博@電影八仙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《八仙！》劇照（微博@電影八仙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260727/1158470558498033664829375.jpeg/i5guEkKqzkmFdErG7TRe9EkJd6cwWVmdn4soR5-LKEc\"/><figcaption>《八仙！》劇照（微博@電影八仙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《八仙！》劇照（微博@電影八仙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260727/1158470560763088896460981.jpeg/0vYtKYKM7GHEc1vS5zI73-f5dCBGMTZPL8axFi_GsRY\"/><figcaption>《八仙！》劇照（微博@電影八仙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《八仙！》劇照（微博@電影八仙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260727/1158470537337376768791352.jpeg/VYuDO9oTA272Mrlh2192rPSDrsFvg-QWM4a0MTOGtDE\"/><figcaption>《八仙！》劇照（微博@電影八仙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《八仙！》劇照（微博@電影八仙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260727/1158470539807952896859231.jpeg/spSTr3W58k_n8W12DAsUfuBe4tRZ6PpjWmwGjlpsBo4\"/><figcaption>《八仙！》劇照（微博@電影八仙）</figcaption></figure><p>王祖賢神隱20年罕現身！授權AI復刻美貌曝心聲</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-18T15:39:51.788848+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1570,"images":36,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}